WEBVTT

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
M-Mirei isn't here...

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.380
Out of battery.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.290
Mirei...

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.500
I'm quitting being an idol.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.690
Eh!?

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.140
Farewell, everyone.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:21.030
Pop Step Garuru!

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.150
Don't say you're quitting being an idol!

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:29.090
If you quit, everyone will think it's pointless to try!

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:30.490
Exactly.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.360
It <i>is</i> pointless...

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:33.900
No it isn't!

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.650
It <i>is</i> pointless, even if I tried 100 times I'd never win!

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:41.760
The only thing I've learned is that potential beats out effort.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:45.790
It's all because I couldn't use my idiot power...

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:51.820
No, it's because Sophie was on the other side.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:54.070
Even if you did it wouldn't have mattered.

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:56.820
I'm the one who said it.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:02:59.320
For now, just go home.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.450
Then I'm gonna quit being an idol too!

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:09.790
Since you're the reason I became an idol!

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.410
I don't want to think of a PriPara without you!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.400
Because I know I would hate it!

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:21.220
Thank you, but I don't think you should quit.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:23.040
Then you shouldn't either!

00:03:23.040 --> 00:03:25.570
Sorry, but just leave.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:49.050
Lala! How did it go? Where's Mirei?

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.170
It was no good.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.460
I thought so, there's no way you could win Mirei over with words-kuma.

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.010
We've gotta think of another way.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:58.920
Yeah.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:03:59.990
Yeah.

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:06.350
I want to perform, I want to perform!

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:09.650
Unless you're Top Class, I can't enter you.

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:10.990
Garu!

00:04:10.990 --> 00:04:11.860
What's happening?

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:13.810
Hey, everyone's here!

00:04:15.110 --> 00:04:16.890
Doesn't she look like Falulu?

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.110
Garu!

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:21.280
Garu!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.380
Eh!? Garuru?

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.070
Garu Garu!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.120
Wow, she's got big again.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.720
You look just like Falulu!

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:30.200
You sure have grown!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.200
Garuru came to do her debut concert!

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.780
But I can't enter...

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:39.690
Garuru when did you get to PriPara?

00:04:39.690 --> 00:04:40.590
Earlier.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.880
Huh? You didn't tell Unicorn?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:43.580
No.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.820
You sure are cheeky!

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:48.530
End this madness right now and come back this instant!

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:49.680
No!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.770
Garuru likes it here!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.140
I'm going to do my debut concert!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.250
Debut?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.840
What are you talking about-dechu?

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.450
You can't-dechu!

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.460
I can!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.820
Garuru has practiced a lot!

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:07.130
True, you have practiced a lot, but

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.000
I'm still worried about you!

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.650
Garuru isn't coming back, I'm doing my debut concert.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.680
Garuru, you really love it here huh?

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.410
Yeah!

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.960
What a bother.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.430
We were already so busy with the Mirei business.

00:05:20.430 --> 00:05:22.360
Have you told Falulu?

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:25.980
No, plan to surprise her later-garu!

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.180
Oh brother.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:30.640
Ahh!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.890
I was so naive-tori.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.220
Mirei won't come,

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:37.690
I can't reach her...

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.770
What on earth should I do-kuma!?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:43.640
Tori is all alone-tori!

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:46.420
Fuwari come back!

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:50.170
What a bunch of troubled souls-nekon.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.640
I'll take out the trash.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.730
Garuru has come-nano!

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.950
I didn't know she'd come back!

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:10.080
What does doing a concert feel like-garu?

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.130
It's really fun!

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.910
When your fans get pumped up,

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.610
it makes you so happy!

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:16.800
Right!

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:19.910
Garuru wants to do a concert, right now!

00:06:19.910 --> 00:06:21.210
I'll sing here!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.600
A non-official concert!

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:24.780
It's all good.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.740
Yay!

00:06:34.550 --> 00:06:36.160
What's happening-nekon?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.520
Garuru!

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:43.320
Kuma, you know...

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:45.740
Garuru wants to do a debut concert.

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:50.220
In order to do it, she's practiced a whole lot!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.700
Can't you do anything for her?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.270
Let's see-kuma...

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:55.120
I can't-kuma!

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.870
She's blocked off by CelePara-kuma!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:07.040
She came here solely to do a debut concert though...

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:11.110
I wanted her to be able to do her debut concert...

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.310
I cannot forgive CelePara for this!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.650
We're all unhappy with CelePara-nekon!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.990
You being crucial for it to function,
are you just gonna sit there and say nothing-nekon?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:24.830
Huh?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:25.380
Huh!

00:07:26.010 --> 00:07:27.610
Isn't that Meganii?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.270
Meganii-nano!

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.790
I thought he'd gone to PriParis.

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.660
It's Meganii-nano! It's Meganii-nano!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:37.070
Ah, hey...

00:07:37.400 --> 00:07:40.500
Are you okay with letting Garuru debut in a place like this-nekon!?

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:44.000
And with Mirei, can you even protect your idols-nekon!?

00:07:44.510 --> 00:07:46.620
I'm powerless...

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:49.000
You coward!

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.750
You're supposed to be on our side, so protect your idols.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.000
What's gonna happen with you being so incompetent-nekon?

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:04.130
What a punch, Neko-neesan.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.930
Having had my position stolen by Hibiki-san,

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:11.500
I'm just a useless guy.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:14.530
Everyone knows it.

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:15.710
Huh?

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:17.680
But...

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.180
If I sit around moping like this...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:24.350
then I can't create a future where Idols can shine!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.810
Exactly.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:29.740
Thanks to you, my eyes are open.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:30.850
No...

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:32.780
I've changed my glasses!

00:08:35.650 --> 00:08:38.870
Those cheap, unstylish glasses are painful to look at.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:42.600
I might be powerless, but I still want to help!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:47.350
With Meganii-san, our power has increased by 2001 times!

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:48.510
Thanks.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:51.050
I'll ask Mirei-san.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:58.670
Thanks to that punch earlier, I've remembered something.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:00.680
Please come.

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:04.870
Here it is.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.340
You remembered a door?

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:10.950
Yes, thanks to Neko-neesan's punch.

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.340
TL Note: "2-9-9"(ni-kyuu-kyuu) sounds like "paw" (nikukyuu)
The password is 2-9-9.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.950
2-9-9

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.190
As I thought!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:26.320
Everyone, please enter.

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:31.630
It looks so old...

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.960
Watch your step!

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:40.520
A stage!?

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.790
In here?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.320
This is PriPara's underground stage.

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:50.230
Even though it's called "underground",
it has a history, as many great idols once performed here.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:51.900
Amazing!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:53.610
Garu.

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:55.380
It's the first time I've seen it.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:58.420
It's been closed for a while,

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:01.870
but if we do some maintenance work,
we should be able to use it again.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:06.470
So you're saying we could hold concerts here?

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:10.750
Sure, but the system here is an old version,

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.800
so it's independent from CelePara.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.420
Which means that it's out of Hibiki-san's control.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:29.190
Garuru's Debut Concert

00:10:31.530 --> 00:10:32.590
Garuru?

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:35.320
Isn't she bad at singing and dancing?

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.280
Concerts...

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.190
aren't my problem anymore.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:59.460
Everyone, although this place is small and old,

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:00.970
and can't broadcast live.

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:03.500
Even if it became usable,

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:05.310
we probably won't get many likes.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:10.050
So to rank up it's gonna take a lot of hard work.

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:10.920
Capisce!
Garu!

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:12.460
Max!
Relax!

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:14.570
Nano! Devi!
Usa! Nekon! Tori!

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.230
Wow!

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:24.350
It's so clean I hardly recognize it!

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:26.730
Underground PriPara has been revived!

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.520
I'm beat!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.430
Alls left to do now is get the fans in!

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:33.200
Garuru will call Falulu!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.440
Garuru will call Falulu! Garuru Falulu!

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:41.270
Yeah, I've gotta call Mirei too.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:55.940
Manaka-san, why are you here?

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:59.320
I told you, I've quit being an idol.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.380
Yeah, but

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:05.380
But Kuma-san said he just <i>has </i>to tell you something!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.760
Tell me something?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:09.920
Mirei!

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.840
If you've truly decided to quit being an idol,

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:13.970
then I can't stop you-kuma.

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:18.090
But if you're gonna quit, you need to go all the way-kuma.

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:19.500
All the way?

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.900
Cancelling our contract-kuma.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.670
I'll find a new idol,

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.070
and make a contract with her-kuma

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:27.910
I see.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.440
To do that, I need the

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:35.030
PriTicket Bag, Cyalume Miracle Pact
and Cyalume Charm returned.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.190
Bring them ASAP.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:40.070
Huh? Fine.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.760
Then I'll have Lala deliver them...

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.660
Manaka-san!

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.470
What is wrong with these people!?

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:54.350
Don't quit, Head Disciplinarian.

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.440
I love your concerts!

00:12:58.360 --> 00:12:59.360
Hello!

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.520
I'll be leaving shortly, so I won't get changed.

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:03.440
Okay.

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:05.930
Get her!

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:09.060
W-What?

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:13.010
S-Stop, I'm going home!

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:14.890
W-What's this?

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:20.020
This concert hall used to be used a long time ago!

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:21.830
Amazing!

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.380
We can still use it-nano!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.670
Is Garuru going to do her concert here?

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:29.400
Yeah! She's just about to.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:31.590
Will she be okay?

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:34.020
She's not good at singing and dancing...

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:38.320
If she messes up, she might lose confidence!

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.490
Scan the PriTickets required for your cord.

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:45.590
Cord Change Start!

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:49.630
Regardless, this has nothing to do with me.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:50.630
I'm leaving.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:51.680
Not so fast.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:59.280
Like an antique clock
mixed with lovely pink, it's the Fairy Tale Cord!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.350
Fairy Tale Clock Cord!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:02.720
Garu!

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:06.800
Give it your all!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.600
Garuru-chan is cute!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:10.310
Garuru...

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.590
Garuru I'm behind you!

00:14:12.590 --> 00:14:14.180
Do your best!

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:15.850
Garuru...

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:19.230
Garuru-san, it's your first concert.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.430
A message of support has come from PriParis!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.000
Garuru, break a leg!

00:14:25.000 --> 00:14:32.600
Garuru, break a leg! Garuru, break a leg!

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.560
Everyone, as you know,

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:39.470
Garuru isn't very good at singing and dancing

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:43.200
and she was born from that complex-dechu.

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:45.940
She is very clumsy,

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:50.820
but she practiced more than any of the others every day.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.080
She gave it everything she had-dechu.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:57.850
And so today,

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:01.970
she will debut in Parajuku's PriPara-dechu!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:06.450
So please, show Garuru the support she deserves-dechu!

00:15:07.980 --> 00:15:08.780
Garuru...

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:12.800
So let's see what effort can do for an unfortunate idol.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.970
As she breaks the chains of inferiority

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.280
and frees herself from her shackles!

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:20.440
Look forward to my debut concert!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.170
Garu!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:12.520
Making Drama, switch on!

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.550
Garu!

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:24.230
Garu!

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:30.820
Welcome to My Sweet Happy Room!

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:34.620
Gajira!

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.460
Garuru!

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.410
Gajira!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.200
Cyalume Change!

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.140
Garu!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.560
Lovely

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.900
Garuru-san is pink lovely!
Lovely

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:16.180
Experimenting
Idol
Garuru-san is pink lovely!

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:17.040
Experimenting
Idol

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:18.750
Your rank has risen to "Experimenting Idol"

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:18.820
Experimenting
Idol

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:20.890
Garuru!

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:21.830
Well done!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:23.950
I did it! I debuted!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:25.290
Well done!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.740
Garuru you were amazing-dechu!

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:32.710
I was a bit nervous,
but you pulled off the perfect concert!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.630
Garuru!

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.120
Garu?

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:39.450
You gave it your all until the very end.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.270
That was an amazing concert.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.630
Better than any I've ever seen before.

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:47.020
You're my Idol of the Year!

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:49.210
Effort isn't wasted.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:53.130
Your efforts moved me to tears.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.150
Garu!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.650
Garuru is the Monster Idol!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.720
Garuru Garuru!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:02.990
Sophie.

00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:08.170
S-Sorry! I...

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.580
Mirei, Mirei.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:15.490
Sophie...

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.460
Mirei, Sophie!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.070
Garuru loves concerts, being an idol is fun!

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:27.660
Wanting to quit being an idol, Mirei is an idiot!

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:29.330
Idiot!?

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:34.140
I-I'm not quitting...

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:34.910
Mirei!?

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.520
I said I'm not quitting!

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:39.480
Yay!

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:41.940
Thank goodness!

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:45.850
Pop Step Get Back!

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:48.570
I'm back, everyone-pri!

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:51.120
Welcome back!

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.340
Kyupi! Kyupi!

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:53.950
We were waiting for you-chanko!

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:54.930
Mirei!

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:57.780
Sophie and I have quit Shikyouin's team!

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:00.480
